{"id":580,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究・国際性・利他を備えるリーダー育成","feature_description":"西大和学園は、探究・誠実・気迫を校訓に、科学的洞察力、国際性、利他の精神を備えたリーダーを育てます。6年一貫の体系的なカリキュラムに、課題研究、SSHの理数教育、AI研究、模擬国連、海外研修などを組み合わせます。学力の伸長と人間的成長を一体で捉え、自然体験や文化行事、クラブ活動、心の教育を通じて、挑戦し創造し他者のために行動できる力を養います。","clubs":[{"id":10929,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nishiyamato.ed.jp/feature/creation.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10930,"name":"硬式テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nishiyamato.ed.jp/feature/creation.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10931,"name":"陸上競技","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nishiyamato.ed.jp/feature/creation.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10932,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nishiyamato.ed.jp/feature/creation.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10933,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nishiyamato.ed.jp/feature/creation.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10934,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nishiyamato.ed.jp/feature/creation.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10935,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nishiyamato.ed.jp/feature/creation.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10936,"name":"柔道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nishiyamato.ed.jp/feature/creation.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10937,"name":"硬式野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nishiyamato.ed.jp/feature/creation.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10938,"name":"中学軟式野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nishiyamato.ed.jp/feature/creation.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10939,"name":"吹奏楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.nishiyamato.ed.jp/feature/creation.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10940,"name":"模擬国連","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.nishiyamato.ed.jp/feature/creation.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10941,"name":"鉄道研究